## Why This Is Asked
Tests the ability to design a compliant, scalable data lifecycle with multi-tenant isolation, clear ownership, and automated governance in a dbt/Snowflake environment.

## Key Concepts
- dbt macros and run-operations for lifecycle management
- Snowflake Tasks and time-based scheduling
- Per-tenant Row-Level Security (RLS) isolation
- Data governance and CI gates for lifecycle policies

## Code Example
```sql
{% macro apply_retention(tenant, table) %}
  {% set policy = ref('retention_policies') | where('tenant = \''~tenant~'\' AND table_name = \''~table~'\'') | first %}
  {% set retention_days = policy.retention_days %}
  {% set archive_schema = policy.archive_schema %}

  {% set move_query %}
    INSERT INTO {{ archive_schema }}.archive_{{ table }}
    SELECT * FROM {{ this }}
    WHERE row_timestamp < DATEADD(day, -{{ retention_days }}, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP());

    DELETE FROM {{ this }}
    WHERE row_timestamp < DATEADD(day, -{{ retention_days }}, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP());
  {% endset %}

  {% do run_query(move_query) %}
{% endmacro %}
```

## Why This Matters
This interview question tests your understanding of macro correctness, multi-tenant schema templating, and CI/CD integration for data quality enforcement.

## Key Concepts
- dbt macros and singular/generic tests
- Per-tenant schemas using `analytics_{{tenant}}` naming convention
- CI gating: blocking deploys when any tenant's test reports NULL violations

## Code Example
```sql
-- analytics_base/macros/not_null_guard.sql
{% macro not_null_guard(tenant, model, col) %}
  (SELECT COUNT(*) FROM analytics_{{ tenant }}.{{ model }} WHERE {{ col }} IS NULL) = 0
{% endmacro %}
```

```sql
-- tests/generic/not_null_guard.sql
{% test not_null_guard(model, col) %}
  {% if execute %}
    {% set result = run_query(not_null_guard(this.name, model, col)) %}
    {% if result.rows[0][0] | int != 0 %}
      {% do exceptions.raise_compile_error(
        "Failed: " ~ model ~ "." ~ col ~ " contains NULL values"
      ) %}
    {% endif %}
  {% endif %}
{% endtest %}
```

The test verifies zero NULL values exist in the target column across all tenant-specific models.
